	abstract = {This project investigates how strategic foresight methodologies can inform and create robust, future orientated strategies for manufacturers.  This project attempts to understand the rapidly changing and increasingly challenging landscape of the manufacturing sector on the verge of the fourth industrial revolution. Building on existing literature related to the continuing evolution of manufacturing, and combined with ethnographic data, the paper explores the historical developments and manufacturers’ current strategies for moving into the expected future.
