	volume = {2742},
	abstract = {This report deacribes research carried out by the SRI Decision Analysis Group for the Defense Advanced Research Projects Agency (DARPA) under contract number MDA903-74-C-02A0 during the period 1 December 1974 tc 1 March 1975. This research effort has two objectives: Task A - Develop a morphology for characterizing and analyzing decision problems to serve as a basis for the design of a system of integrated computer aids for decision making. Task B - Transfer the existing SRI CTREE program to two computers, one available for classified work in the Washington, U. C. area and one accessible through the DARPA computer network. The attached document describes the research under Task A. A report summary is contained therein.},
